Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.79,0:00:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.41,0:00:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.15,0:01:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.69,0:01:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.60,0:01:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.27,0:01:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mana!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.61,0:01:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.75,0:01:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Pharaoh, I beg of you, use your\Npowers and release him from that stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.21,0:01:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Or can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.35,0:01:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me it's not too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.27,0:01:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Mana, Mahad's spirit is very much\Nalive, existing deep within that stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.81,0:01:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, he's even stronger now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.77,0:01:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My Millennium Necklace has shown me all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.83,0:01:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He fused himself together with\Nhis most trusted creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.53,0:01:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.44,0:01:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.19,0:01:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahad has been transformed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.35,0:01:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He will now be known as the Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.27,0:01:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.95,0:01:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My training isn't complete\Nand I need Master Mahad!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.87,0:01:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to become an Elite Spellcaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.35,0:02:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do it alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.99,0:02:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.39,0:02:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.37,0:02:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The world of the Pharaoh's memory!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.05,0:02:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you are correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.73,0:02:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, my work here is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.07,0:02:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you must continue, on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.65,0:02:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but only those who were called\Nupon by the Pharaoh may enter this realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.87,0:02:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.97,0:02:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The king of Egypt is in need of your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.43,0:02:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.57,0:02:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You are going to need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.41,0:02:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one question.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.89,0:02:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How do we get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.07,0:02:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.07,0:02:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I was afraid of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.07,0:02:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Due to Mahad's carelessness, that lunatic\NBakura is more dangerous than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.95,0:02:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, he is in control of\Nthe Millennium Ring. Now wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.21,0:02:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That is yet to be confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.93,0:03:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,For all we know, Bakura was buried under\Nrubble when the Sacred Sanctuary collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.91,0:03:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.99,0:03:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,However, my ki still senses his presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.87,0:03:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And Isis, what does your Millennium\NItem tell you about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.67,0:03:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you see Bakura's future?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.17,0:03:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sadly, I cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.17,0:03:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,On behalf of the Sacred Court,\NI apologize for these failures.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.99,0:03:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.45,0:03:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I speak for every one of us when I say we\Nwill not disappoint you again, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.89,0:03:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sorry, my king.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.25,0:03:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Apologies are not necessary, Isis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.71,0:03:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What we need are solutions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.83,0:03:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, Master Shimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.57,0:03:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall do everything in\Nmy power to break through
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.05,0:03:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,the darkness that conceals\NBakura from my vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.93,0:03:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That is all we can ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.49,0:03:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, with all due respect,\Ntime is of the essence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.17,0:03:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Please allow me to lead\Nthe hunt for Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.27,0:03:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I already have a plan in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.03,0:03:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,To start, all gateways to and from the\Nkingdom must be sealed to keep him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.89,0:04:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, every citizen must be carefully\Nobserved since no one can be trusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.47,0:04:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.38,0:04:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Until we have more information,\Neveryone's a suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.23,0:04:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.19,0:04:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So let it be written, so let it be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.87,0:04:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it me, or did we just travel\Nthrough some kind of time warp?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.49,0:04:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.83,0:04:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We stand out like sore thumbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.81,0:04:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.93,0:04:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But for some weird reason,\Neveryone's ignoring us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.69,0:04:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.55,0:04:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,How you doing, folks?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.77,0:04:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Jumping.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.68,0:04:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey Wheeler here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.61,0:04:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.79,0:04:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.29,0:04:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.83,0:04:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure this nice young\Ngirl knows who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.03,0:04:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.43,0:04:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.29,0:04:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Puzzle is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.05,0:04:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.25,0:05:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're in the world\Nof the Pharaoh's memory,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.41,0:05:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,then it's no wonder people\Ncan't see us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.79,0:05:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't exist 5,000 years ago, so\Nwe're not really a part of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.45,0:05:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.79,0:05:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean when we find the Pharaoh,\Nhe won't be able to see us either?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.81,0:05:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.01,0:05:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's only one way to find out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.11,0:05:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to go see him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.43,0:05:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, do you believe that Bakura\Nstill walks amongst us? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.63,0:05:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He controls a monster with\Npowers equal to an Egyptian god.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.41,0:05:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahad, you saw that for\Nyourself, did you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.13,0:05:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahad was a fool to face him, and\Nthat is why his spirit is now sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.55,0:05:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.57,0:05:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We must strengthen our own army of\Nshadow creatures and take him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.17,0:06:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall accomplish this by\Nextracting these beasts of
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.35,0:06:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,darkness from the souls of\Nthe Egyptian people at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.53,0:06:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, are you suggesting\Nwe punish the innocent?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.39,0:06:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What would the pharaoh say about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.37,0:06:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadda,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.28,0:06:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,the very reason I am doing all this is to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.57,0:06:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,protect the pharaoh and\Nthe citizens of Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.29,0:06:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Guards, stop here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.97,0:06:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And no, I am not targeting the innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.45,0:06:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the souls of potential\Ncriminals that I shall be seeking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.47,0:06:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And punishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.47,0:06:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Guards, here is your mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.71,0:06:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You are all to scour the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.75,0:06:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Any villager you deem suspicious of criminal\Nactivity is to be brought before me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.01,0:06:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.97,0:06:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,One down and five guardians to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.09,0:06:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And then the seven items will be mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.31,0:07:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There's been a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.85,0:07:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.76,0:07:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.67,0:07:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You must believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.59,0:07:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm innocent, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.07,0:07:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There is one way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.01,0:07:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to be judged by the\NMillennium Items. Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.89,0:07:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We overheard this vagrant\Ndisrespecting the pharaoh, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.25,0:07:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that was certainly foolish of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.27,0:07:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Shaddaa, let us see into his spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.19,0:07:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Millennium Key, show me\Nwhat lies within this man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.35,0:07:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I sense an evil spark beginning to grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.49,0:07:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He appears harmless now,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.05,0:07:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,but he most certainly shows potential\Nfor greater evil, Master Seto. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.95,0:07:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This vagrant is useless to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.57,0:07:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Lock him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.09,0:07:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.19,0:07:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you waste your\Nefforts on the lives of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.35,0:07:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a much more serious\Nthreat among us, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.55,0:07:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me, we are all\Nwell aware of Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.31,0:08:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and we've already taken\Nactions to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.49,0:08:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm referring to the White Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.07,0:08:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,White Dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.87,0:08:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.17,0:08:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all true!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.59,0:08:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The White Dragon stalks our town!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.93,0:08:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It emerges by night and\Nthreatens us while we sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.39,0:08:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I have heard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.85,0:08:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.77,0:08:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.25,0:08:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you lock me up and\Nlet the dragon roam free?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.11,0:08:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be sorry for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.85,0:08:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The more chaos I spark, the\Nfaster my dear bound will evolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.95,0:08:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can we take five?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.59,0:08:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe ten?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.13,0:08:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.49,0:08:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.40,0:08:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You know I can't run on an empty stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.71,0:08:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do anything on an empty stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.73,0:09:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, we're here to help\Nthe Pharaoh, not to eat, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.15,0:09:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a hot dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.25,0:09:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say hot dog? Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.01,0:09:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You too, Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.43,0:09:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, guys, it's\Nlike we don't exist here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.47,0:09:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You two aren't even going to be able\Nto touch the food, let alone eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.17,0:09:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, say it ain't so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.57,0:09:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, something's not right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.69,0:09:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.87,0:09:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, that guy's devouring\Neverything in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.81,0:09:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And no one's saying a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.43,0:09:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.83,0:09:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean... Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.47,0:09:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You got some for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.53,0:09:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, I'm being\Nattacked by a hungry ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.49,0:09:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, he can see us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.67,0:09:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.53,0:10:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.33,0:10:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.31,0:10:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.22,0:10:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl's in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.85,0:10:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So you guys want to\Npick on someone, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.79,0:10:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Then pick on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.15,0:10:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And then we'll pick on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.25,0:10:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.61,0:10:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,She can't hear us. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.05,0:10:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,None of these people\Ncan hear us or see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.81,0:10:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder these stones\Ndon't hurt. Think, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.87,0:10:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.41,0:10:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.27,0:10:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.73,0:10:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Double no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.43,0:10:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.71,0:10:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.67,0:10:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.45,0:10:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The power within her!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.09,0:10:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.49,0:11:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadda!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.41,0:11:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never felt such a\Npowerful spirit before. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.89,0:11:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, there is something\Nfamiliar about this girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.29,0:11:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Guards, she comes with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.49,0:11:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Give her all the food\Nand water she desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.75,0:11:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We must hurry, men! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.57,0:11:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And as for all of you, leave at once, or I\Nshall place every one of you in shackles!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.79,0:11:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, fake Kaiba! Look, Yugi! I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.91,0:11:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba has the Millennium Rod!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.89,0:11:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And that guy has the key!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.41,0:11:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.25,0:11:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba was carved on that ancient tablet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.99,0:11:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He must work for the Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.27,0:11:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a word about this to the Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.41,0:11:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We needn't concern him until we have a\Nfull understanding of what's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.51,0:11:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us return to the palace now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.93,0:11:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you guys hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.85,0:11:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, those two guys are\Non their way to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.31,0:11:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,They could be our ticket\Nto see the pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.79,0:11:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.97,0:11:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,To the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.11,0:12:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I always wanted to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.29,0:12:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the size of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.63,0:12:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good to be the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.21,0:12:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We might want to speed things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.43,0:12:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.71,0:12:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The doors are closing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.51,0:12:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.67,0:12:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't sweat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.59,0:12:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We can walk through everything here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.47,0:12:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm sure Solid Stone\NGage are no exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.25,0:12:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.03,0:12:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we invisible or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.91,0:12:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, guys, but I think\Nit's time for one of our famous plan Bs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.77,0:12:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.03,0:12:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.41,0:12:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.81,0:12:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave me quite a scare, for Buzz\Nis not used to people seeing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.97,0:12:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.57,0:12:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, we invisible\Nfolk must stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.99,0:12:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.31,0:13:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't crush us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.81,0:13:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How about a snack?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.25,0:13:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.03,0:13:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you're invisible like us,\Nthen why can you touch things?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.43,0:13:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.34,0:13:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.17,0:13:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.03,0:13:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.11,0:13:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit eating our food!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.15,0:13:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.09,0:13:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.49,0:13:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No more questions!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.37,0:13:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, when I get nervous, I get hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.53,0:13:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.63,0:13:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop making Bulbasa so nervous!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.01,0:13:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to get us\Ninto the palace, Nimrod.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.09,0:13:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.77,0:13:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.68,0:13:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit it, Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.89,0:13:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,At least I'm trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.49,0:13:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and we're trying to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.61,0:13:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're in there, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.97,0:13:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm going to figure\Nout a way to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.45,0:14:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone is calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.45,0:14:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Any suspicious activity here? No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.11,0:14:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I thought I heard\Nsomething, so look alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.19,0:14:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come on to phase two.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.03,0:14:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The shadow game has taken\Nan interesting twist
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.41,0:14:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,as the past and the future\Nhave begun to converge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.09,0:14:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the Egyptian gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.53,0:14:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The pharaoh can only control them\Nthanks to his knowledge of the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.29,0:14:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I have a power he doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.51,0:14:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my newly\Nacquired Millennium Ring,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.71,0:14:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I can enter his majesty's\Npalace undetected.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.69,0:14:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Akhnadden, settle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.55,0:14:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Our mission was a success. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.73,0:14:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We searched the land for shadow creatures\Ndwelling within our citizens' hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.15,0:14:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And our findings were greater\Nthan I could ever have expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.65,0:14:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.15,0:15:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I am not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.45,0:15:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now release these innocent\Npeople immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.17,0:15:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot be serious. Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.49,0:15:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You must do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.11,0:15:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You are starting to head\Ndown a dangerous path, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.45,0:15:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a guardian, and\Nyou must act like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.89,0:15:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Free those people, for you have\Ndisgraced the name of the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.13,0:15:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.31,0:15:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I did this to protect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.41,0:15:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the only way we can defeat Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.89,0:15:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not regret it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.09,0:15:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But Seto, I am sorry, but there's\Nwork to be done. Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.83,0:15:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.15,0:15:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.41,0:15:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.09,0:15:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Not long ago, I made\Nthe same mistake myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.31,0:15:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.55,0:15:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.03,0:16:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she awake? No, sir. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.29,0:16:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.91,0:16:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Her face is so familiar to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.69,0:16:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Can this be the girl I\Nsaw that day so long ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.61,0:16:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the girl with the\Nblue eyes and white hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.19,0:16:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, someone's in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.57,0:16:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That prisoner's been nothing but\Ntrouble since we captured her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.57,0:16:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we should have run her out\Nof town like the rest of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.87,0:16:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Word of advice, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.75,0:16:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,In the next village, take no prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.23,0:16:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.29,0:16:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Saving you. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.37,0:16:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's going somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.15,0:16:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.49,0:17:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,After them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.79,0:17:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The girl is getting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.01,0:17:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.19,0:17:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.10,0:17:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Then my job's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.73,0:17:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this horse to the\Nnext town. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.59,0:17:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The people there will be able to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.79,0:17:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ride through the night if you must.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.49,0:17:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about you? Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.23,0:17:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you? Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.63,0:17:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Seto! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.27,0:17:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall repay you someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.07,0:17:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.33,0:17:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My village!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.75,0:17:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have been those scoundrels!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.79,0:17:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.95,0:17:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.79,0:17:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This land is ours, and\Nwe're taking it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.61,0:17:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.77,0:17:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't belong here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.73,0:17:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's that kid\Nwho freed our prisoner!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.31,0:18:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us where she is! Leave\Nme alone! Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.43,0:18:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.79,0:18:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, get your filthy hands off! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.31,0:18:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.77,0:18:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.15,0:18:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My home!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.99,0:18:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that thing? A monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.97,0:18:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It is her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.83,0:18:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,After all these years, she has returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.95,0:18:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.37,0:18:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Only this time you didn't bring along any\Nof your friends to fight by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.41,0:18:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I, on the other hand, did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.59,0:19:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not quite as impressive without\Nyour younger counterparts to hide behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.51,0:19:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.42,0:19:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I could seize your\NMillennium Eye in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.07,0:19:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have something more amusing\Nin mind. After all, we still
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.77,0:19:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,have a score to settle perhaps\Nyou recall a little incident
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.57,0:19:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Occurring in the village of\NKal Elna a few years ago, you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.09,0:19:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,crushed my people and abandoned\Nyour son a young boy named seto
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.07,0:20:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
